      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.aberdeenwa.gov/257/History"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The town is a pilgrimage spot for Nirvana fans, honoring Kurt Cobain and fellow Aberdeen native Krist Novoselic.",
